    "body": "I get that my question was more like why `AWSU_PROFILE` comes before `AWSUME_PROFILE` and why `AWS_VAULT` has higher search priority than the latter. I guess we are safe to assume that users won't have multiple AWS credential managers installed so we are good even the search order seems pretty random.",
